Operation: CREATE_CLAIM - Create a research claim
Arguments: {"kind": "research" | "foundation" | "methodology" | "principle" | "example", "title": string, "description": string, "content": string, "methodology": string[], "sources": string[], "topics": string[]}
Request: create a claim: "Hybrid retrieval beats BM25 on long-tail queries". kind: empirical. methodology: offline eval on 500 queries. source: internal benchmark, Oct 2026. topics: search, retrieval.

Operation: ADD_RESEARCH_CONNECTION - Add a connection to another research claim
Arguments: {"targetRef": string, "contextPhrase": string}
