Operation: CREATE_OBSERVATION - Capture a new friction signal
Arguments: {"category": "FRICTION" | "METHODOLOGY" | "PROCESS" | "QUALITY" | "SURPRISE", "title": string, "description": string}
Request: log an observation, friction: reviewers keep missing the provenance panel because it's collapsed by default

Operation: CREATE_OBSERVATION - Capture a new friction signal
Arguments: {"category": "FRICTION" | "METHODOLOGY" | "PROCESS" | "QUALITY" | "SURPRISE", "title": string, "description": string}
