Operation: CREATE_TENSION - Identify a new contradiction
Arguments: {"title": string, "description": string, "involvedRefs": string[]}
Request: create a tension "Freshness vs. stability": reindexing nightly keeps results fresh but makes rankings jumpy. It involves the nightly reindex note and the ranking stability note.

Operation: RESOLVE_TENSION - Mark as resolved with explanation
Arguments: {"resolution": string}
Request: we settled it: reindex nightly, but only swap the ranking model weekly

Operation: DISSOLVE_TENSION - Mark as dissolved (apparent, not real)
Arguments: {"resolution": string}
Request: dissolve this tension, turns out the two notes were measuring different things

Operation: ADD_INVOLVED_REF - Add a note to the tension
Arguments: {"ref": string}
Request: the "Cache warmup after deploy" note is part of this conflict too

Operation: ADD_TASK - Add a new task to the pipeline
Arguments: {"taskType": "claim" | "enrichment", "target": string}
Request: add an extract task for "Database Internals ch. 7"

Operation: ADD_TENSION - Add an unresolved tension
Arguments: {"description": string, "involvedRefs": string[]}
Request: add a tension between "SLOs beat static thresholds" and "Dashboards nobody reads": SLO alerts hide the per-host detail the dashboards were built to show

Operation: TOGGLE_FEATURE - Enable/disable a feature block
Arguments: {"feature": string, "enabled": boolean}
Request: turn on the semantic-search feature

Operation: UPDATE_MAINTENANCE_THRESHOLD - Update a maintenance threshold
Arguments: {"condition": "orphanThreshold" | "danglingThreshold" | "inboxPressure" | "observationAccumulation" | "tensionAccumulation" | "mocOversize" | "staleNoteDays", "threshold": number}
Request: only nag me once a map gets past 60 entries instead of 40

Operation: UPDATE_VOCABULARY - Update a vocabulary term
